  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 as a snack and takes about 30 minutes. The thing to watch is the oil temperature: the plantain needs to go into very hot oil to get the caramelised exterior before the inside goes soft. Too cool and the plantain absorbs the oil and becomes greasy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use plantain that is very ripe with black skin. The sweetness of the ripe plantain against the heat of the sauce is what makes alloco so compelling."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "plantain",
              "amount": 3,
              "unit": "very ripe, black-skinned",
